How important are the following factors when choosing
a computational musicology/MIR library? Participants were
asked to rate the importance on a scale from 1 to 5 (with 5 being the
highest importance) of the following factors: Ease of integration
with other software; Availability of well-documented API and ex-
amples; Speed and efficiency of processing; Cross-platform compat-
ibility (e.g., Windows, MacOS, Linux); Active community support;
Availability of pre-trained models; Easy-to-use graphical interface;
Programming Language. This helps identify the criteria that guide
tool selection, offering insight into user priorities and expectations

